2783	    /// this also feeds every Kitty placeholder cell to the decoder, and
2784	    /// when `graphemes` is true, this also looks up grapheme cells.
2785	    ///
2786	    /// Each combination of `placeholders` and `graphemes` produces its
2787	    /// own function. `row` inlines the common one (without either) and
2788	    /// calls the others out of line, so the handling of these rare cells
