 378	    /// Holder for the pixel data backing a `GdkMemoryTexture`. GTK
 379	    /// ref-counts the `GBytes` we hand it and calls `memoryDestroy`
 380	    /// when it no longer needs the data, at which point we can return
 381	    /// the pixels to the allocator.
